# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HOMi client — production build values (Vite, `vite build` / `--mode production`).
# Committed so the production bundle targets the live backend out of the box.
# A platform env var (e.g. set in Vercel's dashboard) still overrides any value
# here, since existing env vars take precedence over .env files in Vite.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Live backend, deployed at https://api.homi-platform.com. Must end in /api.
# Socket.IO derives its origin by stripping the trailing /api.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.homi-platform.com/api
